    {
      "id": "section:4/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "irqbalance: automatic balancing",
      "source_hash": 17225184169233454059,
      "context_hash": 10331681284249748869,
      "translation": "irqbalance: 자동 균형 조정",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:33:34.280765Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "`irqbalance` is a daemon that periodically rebalances IRQs across CPUs:",
      "source_hash": 11506396085966607255,
      "context_hash": 692931735655989098,
      "translation": "`irqbalance`는 주기적으로 IRQ를 CPU들에 재분배하는 데몬입니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU",
        "IRQ": "IRQ",
        "daemon": "데몬"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:33:34.280765Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "For latency-sensitive workloads, stop irqbalance and set affinity manually.",
      "source_hash": 15149812349391995019,
      "context_hash": 18092407896265536395,
      "translation": "지연 시간에 민감한 워크로드에서는 irqbalance를 중지하고 어피니티를 수동으로 설정하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "affinity": "어피니티",
        "latency": "지연 시간",
        "workload": "워크로드"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:29:43.088879Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Kernel API: irq_set_affinity_hint",
      "source_hash": 9336202045445150970,
      "context_hash": 6766502748424917953,
      "translation": "커널 API: irq_set_affinity_hint",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "API": "API",
        "kernel": "커널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:33:34.280766Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Drivers can suggest preferred CPUs for their IRQs:",
      "source_hash": 2917263286798930490,
      "context_hash": 11654626448591825646,
      "translation": "드라이버는 자신의 IRQ에 대해 선호하는 CPU를 제안할 수 있습니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU",
        "IRQ": "IRQ"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:33:34.280766Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "NIC drivers like mlx5 use `irq_set_affinity_hint` in their queue setup to suggest NUMA-local CPUs:",
      "source_hash": 18325054275515154239,
      "context_hash": 17498273672141826679,
      "translation": "mlx5 같은 NIC 드라이버는 큐 설정 과정에서 `irq_set_affinity_hint`를 사용하여 NUMA 로컬 CPU를 제안합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU",
        "NIC": "NIC",
        "NUMA": "NUMA",
        "queue": "큐"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:33:34.280766Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "CPU isolation for real-time workloads",
      "source_hash": 2063744036040607765,
      "context_hash": 1663838794710941742,
      "translation": "실시간 워크로드를 위한 CPU 격리",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU",
        "workload": "워크로드"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:33:34.280766Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "For real-time tasks that must not be interrupted, isolate CPUs from the kernel's scheduler and interrupt balancer:",
      "source_hash": 4502549998397527053,
      "context_hash": 8801176885685549025,
      "translation": "인터럽트되어서는 안 되는 실시간 태스크를 위해서는 커널의 스케줄러와 인터럽트 밸런서로부터 CPU를 격리하십시오:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU",
        "interrupt": "인터럽트",
        "scheduler": "스케줄러"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:33:34.280766Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "isolcpus: remove CPUs from the scheduler",
      "source_hash": 9043509591999127144,
      "context_hash": 17659474974000325479,
      "translation": "isolcpus: 스케줄러에서 CPU 제외",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU",
        "scheduler": "스케줄러"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:33:34.280766Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "nohz_full: tickless operation",
      "source_hash": 16631752869971585888,
      "context_hash": 14530574829197768224,
      "translation": "nohz_full: tickless 동작",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:33:34.280766Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "The NO_HZ (tickless idle) feature was introduced in Linux 2.6.21 by Ingo Molnár and Thomas Gleixner [(LWN)](https://lwn.net/Articles/223185/); `nohz_full` for full dynticks came later in Linux 3.10.",
      "source_hash": 3290583874646383651,
      "context_hash": 10467354874467966140,
      "translation": "NO_HZ(tickless idle) 기능은 Linux 2.6.21에서 Ingo Molnár와 Thomas Gleixner가 도입했으며[(LWN)](https://lwn.net/Articles/223185/), full dynticks를 위한 `nohz_full`은 이후 Linux 3.10에서 추가되었습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "LWN": "LWN",
        "Linux": "Linux",
        "Thomas": "Thomas"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:33:34.280766Z",
      "issues": []
    },
