    {
      "id": "section:8/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Receive Packet Steering (RPS/RFS)",
      "source_hash": 17582612522087066201,
      "context_hash": 2415596763867654941,
      "translation": "Receive Packet Steering(RPS/RFS)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:33:34.280767Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "For NICs with fewer hardware queues than CPUs, RPS steers packets to specific CPUs in software:",
      "source_hash": 5273265423339540572,
      "context_hash": 12620312395359125432,
      "translation": "하드웨어 큐가 CPU 수보다 적은 NIC의 경우, RPS는 소프트웨어에서 패킷을 특정 CPU로 보냅니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU",
        "NIC": "NIC",
        "hardware queue": "하드웨어 큐"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:33:34.280767Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "RPS is implemented as a softirq that moves packet processing to the target CPU via IPI (inter-processor interrupt).",
      "source_hash": 4276686596363647511,
      "context_hash": 1684380858856446550,
      "translation": "RPS는 IPI(inter-processor interrupt, 프로세서 간 인터럽트)를 통해 패킷 처리를 대상 CPU로 옮기는 softirq로 구현됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU",
        "IPI": "IPI",
        "interrupt": "인터럽트",
        "softirq": "softirq"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:33:34.280767Z",
      "issues": []
    },
